{"product":{"id":9728654344417,"title":"MANGO 102","body_html":"<p>The Mango 102 is our everyday park platform, cultivated by Jake Mageau, the most evolved style in skiing. This 102mm twin carries the Mango feel in and out of the park.</p>\n<p>True to our Oregon-grown freestyle roots, the Mango Series spans three widths (90, 102, and 114) and is built around a soft, snappy core flex and aggressively rounded tip taper for more pop and smoother edge transitions. On the Mango 102, a close-to-center mount and Elliptical Sidecut keep the ski balanced through presses, swaps, and off-axis rotations. More ski underfoot adds support on landings and through mixed snow outside the park. Signature Rocker keeps the feel playful and buttery wherever you take it. This is the Mango for skiers who spend most of the day in the park and want one ski that handles the rest. Grow your flow.</p>\n<p><span>Every Mango 102 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon, our proprietary composite weave that improves strength and durability while decreasing weight. Pair that with our trademark 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing, and you have the most versatile park ski we know how to build.</span></p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:17:29-07:00","handle":"mango-102","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:30:21-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Mango, Stock Ski","variants":[{"id":49128489189601,"product_id":9728654344417,"title":"161cm / Stock","price":"799.00","sku":"27ON3PM102161","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"161cm","option2":"Stock","option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:17:29-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":50111738937569,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb